476 - Burdens Are Lifted at Calvary
 / 
Key: F
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 476
Topic: Christian Life - 

Verse 1:
[F]Days are filled with sor-row and [C7]care,
[C7]Hearts are lonely and [F]drear;
[Bb]Burdens are lifted [F]at Calvary,
[C7]Jesus is [F]very near.

Refrain:
[Bb]Burdens are lifted [F]at Calvary,
[F]Calvary, Calvary,
[Bb]Burdens are lifted [F]at Calvary,
